── FACT BEYOND A `without` LIMIT ─────── E0204_panicking_callee.lt:3:60  [E0204]

`ratio` can panic, through a division, but `share` says `without panic`:

  3 │ pub fn share(part: i64, whole: i64) -> i64 without panic { ratio(part, whole) }
    │                                                    ───── the limit
    │                                                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

A `without` promises that the code, and everything it calls, never does what the
limit names. Change the code so that it can't, or remove the limit if the code
needs it.
